    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pills of Dreams is a psychological co-op horror game where you play as children subjected to secret experiments by a pharmaceutical corporation. Under the guise of therapy, you're sent into artificial nightmares \u2014 distorted worlds that reflect your deepest fears. Here, thoughts take shape, logic collapses, and the path to awakening is open only to those who dare to face their shadow. This isn\u2019t a cure. It\u2019s a trial. And you are not alone in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/d429606913a14ffa4bf8afa91858414d.avif?t=1747246179\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/7ebc9f6cee07fbe0a6c457e1aa5ddc90.poster.avif?t=1747246179\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/7ebc9f6cee07fbe0a6c457e1aa5ddc90.webm?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/7ebc9f6cee07fbe0a6c457e1aa5ddc90.mp4?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to four players to explore the liminal spaces of shared nightmares and experience the game alongside your friends. Cooperation, solving puzzles together, and coordinated actions will make your descent into distorted worlds even deeper and more immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/bac16b9826efa38e0cc943d987e0df9c.avif?t=1747246179\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/79c9f6636396858e9441deb8f72b94fb.poster.avif?t=1747246179\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/79c9f6636396858e9441deb8f72b94fb.webm?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/79c9f6636396858e9441deb8f72b94fb.mp4?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liminal Spaces</strong> \u2014 each location is a unique blend of fantasy and fear. In these places, the boundaries of reality blur, and hidden threats lurk beneath the surface, keeping you constantly on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scalable Difficulty</strong> \u2014 challenges automatically adjust based on the number of players, creating the perfect balance of tension and teamwork. This ensures that every participant plays an important role in the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous Entities</strong> \u2014 locations are filled with unique enemies, each with their own traits. To survive, you'll need to study their behavior and develop tactics tailored to each one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Gameplay</strong> \u2014 every trial introduces something new: unusual mechanics, fresh objectives, and different approaches. These elements keep the experience exciting and prevent repetition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Versions of Levels</strong> \u2014 each location has a more intense variation, where danger increases and the death of even a single player leads to failure, raising the stakes and keeping the tension high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soundtrack</strong> \u2014 the music sets the tone for each environment, enhancing immersion and amplifying the atmosphere of the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Close Community Involvement</strong> \u2014 your ideas matter, and we actively implement community feedback in future updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/49fdb008b99855c05d9fbae16807103b.avif?t=1747246179\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/5965a33c5e5ef945951fbe87979c27eb.poster.avif?t=1747246179\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/5965a33c5e5ef945951fbe87979c27eb.webm?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/5965a33c5e5ef945951fbe87979c27eb.mp4?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character that fully reflects your style. Customize appearance, clothing, and accessories to suit your taste. Unlock unique customization items as rewards for completing challenges and stand out among your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/0f61a75807df4149523e38526ead674a.poster.avif?t=1747246179\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/0f61a75807df4149523e38526ead674a.webm?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/0f61a75807df4149523e38526ead674a.mp4?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your personal room by giving it a sense of comfort and individuality. Arrange furniture, choose wallpapers, change background music, and hang posters \u2014 let the space speak for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/855a1c503ae94ab1d919213289962642.avif?t=1747246179\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/be5063d4caa95512f40194bf91813657.poster.avif?t=1747246179\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/be5063d4caa95512f40194bf91813657.webm?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/be5063d4caa95512f40194bf91813657.mp4?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spatial voice chat enhances immersion, while the emote wheel adds expressiveness and personality to every interaction \u2014 making communication with friends feel more lively and engaging.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pills of Dreams is a psychological co-op horror game where you play as children subjected to secret experiments by a pharmaceutical corporation. Under the guise of therapy, you're sent into artificial nightmares \u2014 distorted worlds that reflect your deepest fears. Here, thoughts take shape, logic collapses, and the path to awakening is open only to those who dare to face their shadow. This isn\u2019t a cure. It\u2019s a trial. And you are not alone in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/d429606913a14ffa4bf8afa91858414d.avif?t=1747246179\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/7ebc9f6cee07fbe0a6c457e1aa5ddc90.poster.avif?t=1747246179\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/7ebc9f6cee07fbe0a6c457e1aa5ddc90.webm?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/7ebc9f6cee07fbe0a6c457e1aa5ddc90.mp4?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to four players to explore the liminal spaces of shared nightmares and experience the game alongside your friends. Cooperation, solving puzzles together, and coordinated actions will make your descent into distorted worlds even deeper and more immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/bac16b9826efa38e0cc943d987e0df9c.avif?t=174