has a more intense variation, where danger increases and the death of even a single player leads to failure, raising the stakes and keeping the tension high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soundtrack</strong> \u2014 the music sets the tone for each environment, enhancing immersion and amplifying the atmosphere of the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Close Community Involvement</strong> \u2014 your ideas matter, and we actively implement community feedback in future updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/49fdb008b99855c05d9fbae16807103b.avif?t=1747246179\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/5965a33c5e5ef945951fbe87979c27eb.poster.avif?t=1747246179\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/5965a33c5e5ef945951fbe87979c27eb.webm?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/5965a33c5e5ef945951fbe87979c27eb.mp4?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character that fully reflects your style. Customize appearance, clothing, and accessories to suit your taste. Unlock unique customization items as rewards for completing challenges and stand out among your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/0f61a75807df4149523e38526ead674a.poster.avif?t=1747246179\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/0f61a75807df4149523e38526ead674a.webm?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/0f61a75807df4149523e38526ead674a.mp4?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your personal room by giving it a sense of comfort and individuality. Arrange furniture, choose wallpapers, change background music, and hang posters \u2014 let the space speak for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/855a1c503ae94ab1d919213289962642.avif?t=1747246179\" data-has-big width=800 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/be5063d4caa95512f40194bf91813657.poster.avif?t=1747246179\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/be5063d4caa95512f40194bf91813657.webm?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932790/extras/be5063d4caa95512f40194bf91813657.mp4?t=1747246179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spatial voice chat enhances immersion, while the emote wheel adds expressiveness and personality to every interaction \u2014 making communication with friends feel more lively and engaging.</p>",
